### ── MINDFULNESS EXERCISES ────────────────────────────────────

### [76] Initialize default exercises (idempotent — safe to re-run)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/exercises/initialize
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### [77] Get all exercises
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### [78] Get exercises by type: BREATHING
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/exercises/type/BREATHING
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### [79] Get exercises by type: MEDITATION
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/exercises/type/MEDITATION
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### [80] Get exercise details — captures exerciseId
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/exercises/1/details
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
  client.global.set("exerciseId", 1);
%}

###

### [81] Get sound options for exercise dropdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/exercises/sound-options
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### [82] Assign sound to exercise
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/exercises/{{exerciseId}}/sound?soundId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### [83] Set custom duration (600 s = 10 min)
