Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### [84] Start exercise session with sound and custom duration
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/exercises/{{exerciseId}}/start?soundId=1&duration=300
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### [85] Start exercise session with no sound (default duration)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/exercises/{{exerciseId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

