### ── REMINDERS ────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [86] Get all available reminder types
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders/types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### [87] Create a general reminder — captures reminderId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "user": { "id": {{userId}} },
  "timeOfDay": "09:00:00",
  "daysOfWeek": "MON,TUE,WED,THU,FRI",
  "type": "GENERAL",
  "message": "Take a moment to breathe and reset.",
  "enabled": true
}

> {%
  client.global.set("reminderId", response.body.reminder.id);
%}

###

### [88] Create affirmation reminder (convenience endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders/affirmation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "affirmationId": {{affirmationId}},
  "timeOfDay": "08:00:00",
  "daysOfWeek": "MON,WED,FRI"
}

###

### [89] Create general reminder (convenience endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders/general
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "timeOfDay": "20:00:00",
  "daysOfWeek": "MON,TUE,WED,THU,FRI,SAT,SUN",
  "message": "Time for your evening journal."
}

###

### [90] Get all reminders (admin/debug)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

