Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### [94] Get reminder by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders/{{reminderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### [95] Update reminder
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders/{{reminderId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "timeOfDay": "10:00:00",
  "daysOfWeek": "MON,WED,FRI",
  "message": "Updated: midday mindfulness break.",
  "enabled": true
}

###

### [96] Toggle reminder off
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders/{{reminderId}}/toggle?enabled=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### [97] Toggle reminder back on
