### ── ERROR / EDGE CASES ───────────────────────────────────────

### [108] Duplicate registration — expects 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kind Test User",
  "email": "kindtest@kind.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

###

### [109] Login with wrong password — expects 401/403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kindtest@kind.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword1"
}

###

### [110] Access protected endpoint without token — expects 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users

###

### [111] Get non-existent user — expects 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### [112] Get non-existent mood entry — expects 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mood-entries/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### [113] Get non-existent reminder — expects 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reminders/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### [114] Weak password (no uppercase) — expects 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Weak Password User",
  "email": "weak@kind.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

